{"sections":{"single_image_UM8EHK":{"type":"single-image","settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/10-years-header-image.png","full_width":false,"disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"rich_text_LRk3ig":{"type":"rich-text","blocks":{"subheading_VEWMQ9":{"type":"subheading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Subheading for this section"}},"heading_W7WBUa":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"Kenny Flowers was founded by Kenny 10 years ago to bring vacation energy to his and his friends’ everyday life through a line of high-quality resort wear with a unique focus on vibrant designs, the finest fabrics, and a better fit that just feels right. Inspired by a love for travel and the joy of living in the moment, the brand has always been about celebrating life's moments—big or small. Which is why we are excited to be celebrating our 10 year anniversary this year with you. ","size":"h4"}},"text_R6bbRf":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"","custom_liquid":"","size":"text-size-regular"}},"button_9kjH69":{"type":"button","disabled":true,"settings":{"link_label":"Learn More","link":"","button_outline":false}}},"block_order":["subheading_VEWMQ9","heading_W7WBUa","text_R6bbRf","button_9kjH69"],"settings":{"section_width":"grid","text_width":"xlarge","text_position":"center","text_alignment":"center","color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_text":"#151515","color_links":"#151515","disable_top_spacing":true,"disable_bottom_spacing":true}},"layered_images_with_text_7QeXfr":{"type":"layered-images-with-text","blocks":{"heading_gXPadh":{"type":"heading","settings":{"text":"KENNY FLOWERS EMBODIES THE IDEAL MODERN VACATION: A LITTLE BIT OF LUXE, A LOT OF FUN, AND GUARANTEED SUNSHINE ON YOU AT ALL TIMES.","heading_size":"h4"}},"subheading_c3bmfB":{"type":"subheading","settings":{"text":""}},"heading_wBdmx6":{"type":"heading","disabled":true,"settings":{"text":"Image with text","heading_size":"h3"}},"text_WbW8ik":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>From our origins of our dad’s hand-me-down Hawaiian shirts, to our now expansive line of swimwear, resort-wear, golf, kids, and dresses, Kenny Flowers is designed for everyone. <\/p>"}}},"block_order":["heading_gXPadh","subheading_c3bmfB","heading_wBdmx6","text_WbW8ik"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Kenny-Flowers-Mens-St-Lucia-multi-color-fish-swim-trunks-6_1_-2.png","image_ratio":"adapt","image_2":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/kenny-flowers-watercolors-swim-womens-ruffle-bandeau-bikini-top-kona-pink-purple-10_1.png","image_ratio_2":"adapt","image_3":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/amalfi-collection.png","image_ratio_3":"adapt","full_width":false,"layout":"image_first","content_alignment":"text-left","content_position":"middle","disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"testimonials_HTxKMm":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"quote_NQr3rX":{"type":"quote","settings":{"stars":"","text":"“Kenny Flowers has always been about being the smile you want and the party you're looking for, no matter where you are or what you’re doing. That is what Kenny Flowers is all about.  A better fit. A fresher design. And a simple reminder to keep a smile on and have a good time, one button down at a time.”","author":"Kenny Haisfield, Founder & CEO, Kenny Flowers"}}},"block_order":["quote_NQr3rX"],"settings":{"full_width":true,"text_size":"small","pagination":"dots","autoplay":true,"autoplay_length":5,"color_bg":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","color_text":"#151515","disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"main":{"type":"main-page","disabled":true,"settings":{"show_page_title":true,"disable_top_spacing":false,"disable_bottom_spacing":false}},"timeline_baAMhG":{"type":"timeline","blocks":{"column_6d7JFy":{"type":"column","settings":{"subheading":"2015","heading":"2015","text":"<p>Kenny Flowers was born with a one-way ticket to Bali, Indonesia, where Kenny went on an adventure to create a better-fitting, better-feeling button-down shirt. <\/p>","link_label":"","link":""}},"col